UPDATE tools SET description = $x$AI platform that generates conversion-optimized ad creatives, social media posts, product photos, and video ads. Acquired by Appier in a deal that closed March 2025.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'adcreative-ai' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$AdCreative.ai is a Paris-based AI platform for generating conversion-optimized advertising creatives, including display ads, social media posts, banners, product and fashion photography, and video ads. The platform has also added competitor analysis and a compliance checker to its toolset.

Appier, a Taiwan-based AI marketing company headquartered in Taipei and listed in Tokyo, announced its acquisition of AdCreative.ai on February 12, 2025, for a total of roughly $38.7 million; the deal closed on March 4, 2025. The product continues to operate under the AdCreative.ai brand and domain, and Appier is now expanding it into APAC markets including Thailand and Vietnam.

Core capabilities include AI ad creative generation across formats such as Facebook, Google, and banner ads, social media post generation, AI product and fashion photography, video ad creation, competitor analysis, a compliance checker, brand kit integration, and direct publishing integrations with Meta Ads and Google Ads. The platform also scores generated creatives for predicted conversion performance using a proprietary model trained on advertising data.

Pricing runs on a credit system rather than download counts. Starter is $39 per month for 10 credits per month, 1 brand, and 1 user. Professional is $249 per month for 50 credits per month, up to 10 brands, and 10 users. Ultimate is $999 per month for 100 credits per month, up to 25 brands, and 20 users. Enterprise pricing is custom with dedicated account management. Quarterly billing gets a 25% discount and annual billing a 50% discount. There is no permanently free plan; AdCreative.ai offers a 7-day free trial that can be cancelled anytime.

Limitations include a recognizable AI aesthetic that may not suit premium or luxury brand positioning, and performance scoring that is predictive rather than guaranteed — actual ad results still depend on targeting and campaign management. The Starter tier's 10 credits per month, single brand, and single user make it restrictive for anyone beyond solo use. The vendor's claimed prediction-accuracy figures are not independently verified.

The platform is best suited for performance marketers, e-commerce brands, and digital agencies running paid advertising campaigns who need to generate and test multiple creative variants at scale.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'adcreative-ai' AND lang = 'en';

