UPDATE tools SET description = $x$Low-code platform for building internal business tools — dashboards, admin panels, data editors — with AI components and agentic workflows. Free plan covers up to 5 users; paid tiers separate Builder and Internal User seats, billed monthly or annually (Team Builder seats $10/mo annual or $12/mo monthly; Business Builder seats $50/mo annual or $65/mo monthly).$x$
 WHERE slug = 'retool-ai' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$Retool is a low-code development platform for building internal business applications — admin panels, data dashboards, customer support tools, and operational workflows — by connecting directly to databases and APIs.

As of 2026, Retool organizes its platform around Agents, Workflows, and Apps. Retool Agents are now a distinct add-on for autonomous agents handling customer support, data analysis, and process automation, billed hourly and separately from each plan's included AI credits. "Retool AI" now functions as a general description of these AI capabilities rather than a separate product line.

Retool AI lets teams embed LLM-powered components into apps: AI form completion, AI data summarization, AI chatbots within internal dashboards, and agentic workflows that chain multiple AI steps with human-in-the-loop approval gates. The platform connects to data sources including Postgres, MySQL, Snowflake, MongoDB, REST APIs, and GraphQL. The drag-and-drop builder creates UIs while pre-built components handle common patterns. Key capabilities include a visual app builder, database and API connections, AI components (LLM text generation, AI form assistants), an agentic workflow builder with human-in-the-loop steps, JavaScript and Python support for custom logic, audit logs, and role-based access control.

Retool's Free plan covers up to 5 users with unlimited web and mobile apps but is metered: 500 workflow runs per month, 5GB database capacity, 5GB file storage, 250 AI credits per month, and up to 20 agent hours per month. Paid plans split Builder seats (people who build apps) from cheaper Internal User seats (people who only use them). Team Builder seats cost $10 per user per month billed annually or $12 billed monthly; Team Internal User seats cost $5 per user per month annually or $7 monthly. Business Builder seats cost $50 per user per month annually or $65 monthly; Business Internal User seats cost $15 per user per month annually or $18 monthly. Enterprise pricing is custom. Retool Agents are billed separately by the hour at rates that vary by model capability, with a free allowance of up to 20 agent hours per month included across all tiers.

Retool is optimized for internal tools — it is not suitable for building customer-facing production apps. AI agents are billed hourly on top of per-seat costs, which can make total spend harder to predict for teams that use agents heavily. The visual builder, while powerful for Retool's use case, requires familiarity with data concepts (queries, transformations) to use effectively.

Best suited for operations, product, and engineering teams at startups and enterprises who need to build custom internal tools on top of their existing data sources — particularly those adding AI-assisted workflows to existing business operations.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'retool-ai' AND lang = 'en';

